WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.500
I've spent more than 30 years building companies and products
through several generations of technology.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.830
And the pattern is always the same.

3
00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:12.440
A new technology arrives with
enormous promise.

4
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.110
Then comes the noise.

5
00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.210
The claims.

6
00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.980
The pressure to move quickly.

7
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.707
And very often,

8
00:00:18.707 --> 00:00:26.250
businesses are asked to make important decisions before anyone really
knows which ideas will survive contact with reality.

9
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.540
That is why I built yellow3.

10
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:32.400
We research emerging technology,
test the claims,

11
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:39.740
and look for the places where it can genuinely remove
complexity or help a business operate better.

12
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:43.290
When we find something useful, we
build around it.

13
00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.960
That can mean software.

14
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.880
It can mean a new platform.

15
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:54.355
Or it can mean helping a company make a difficult
decision with better evidence in the room.

16
00:00:54.355 --> 00:00:56.820
What matters to me is that the
technology has a purpose.

17
00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:01.450
I do not believe the goal should be to remove
people from the equation.

18
00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:06.006
Technology should increase what people
can accomplish.

19
00:01:06.006 --> 00:01:09.710
Machines can carry more of the execution.

20
00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.380
They can research, analyse,

21
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.310
organise and build at a scale that was
not possible before.

22
00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:16.900
But people still define the purpose.

23
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:19.840
People still make the
consequential decisions.

24
00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:24.330
And people remain responsible for
the outcome.

25
00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:25.430
That is yellow3.

26
00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:26.610
Research before claims.

27
00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:29.090
Practical technology over hype.

28
00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:32.380
And humans responsible for what
happens next.
